# docs/.docignore — paths excluded from doc-index orphan checks.
#
# These are human-facing published documentation (the MkDocs site), not SDLC
# pipeline artefacts loaded via `cataforge docs load <doc_id>#§N`, so they need
# no YAML front matter `id`. SDLC docs (prd/ arch/ dev-plan/ reviews/ research/
# …) are deliberately NOT listed here and stay orphan-checked.
#
# Syntax: one glob per line; `#` comments and blank lines ignored. A trailing
# `/` excludes a directory and everything under it; otherwise the line is an
# fnmatch glob (relative to docs/) whose `*` also crosses `/`.

README.md
faq.md
contributing.md
architecture/
assets/
getting-started/
guide/
migration/
proposals/
reference/
viz/
